/**
 * «أكاديمية مدرسة شاهين» — the new missions of the school (scripts/shaheen-school):
 *   1. ALL known programming languages (100+) — what each one is and what it is used for.
 *   2. Building programming blocks and scheduling them (paired with src/utils/shaheenBlocks.ts).
 *   3. Software engineering in full, and the graphics & design sciences.
 *   4. Website maintenance (a full course).
 *   5. Every AI tool of the platform — its field and how to develop it in that field.
 * Every lesson is a TrainingDoc of Shaheen's own library: the school teaches him these WITHOUT any AI
 * (exam → selfLesson → memory), so he relies on himself in all of them — intensive and fast.
 * Pure data (no Node or DOM): imported by scripts/shaheen-school/school.ts and run.mts, and tested by
 * tests/shaheenSchoolAcademy.test.ts (every question must find exactly its own lesson).
 */
